{"unit_id":"LYL-Z__dsh-armorbreak#card-zh","repo":"LYL-Z/dsh-armorbreak","commit":"5a5f5165acd829a181a43f6de01e4687328aa629","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ArmorBreak（破甲模式）是面向 DSH Web 客户端的授权安全研究工具集，通过 Cordis bundle 接入 agent preset、模型工具和状态面板。它提供二进制、Android APK、PCAP、源码、Web API、文件取证与 CTF 等分析能力，可将多步分析组成工作流，并记录任务、证据、发现及审计信息，生成 Markdown、HTML、JSON、SARIF 或 PDF 报告。适合需要在本地整理分析过程并保留可复核证据的研究者。需要 Node.js 22 或更高版本；无需额外 API 密钥，部分能力可选使用已安装的外部分析工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-20","tools.js:661-738","packages/core/src/reports.js:1-11","package.json:34-45"]}
{"unit_id":"LYL-Z__dsh-armorbreak#card-en","repo":"LYL-Z/dsh-armorbreak","commit":"5a5f5165acd829a181a43f6de01e4687328aa629","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ArmorBreak is a DSH web research toolkit with an agent preset, tools, and status panel. It analyzes binaries, APKs, PCAPs, source, web APIs, and forensic files. Workflows retain evidence and findings and export Markdown, HTML, JSON, SARIF, or PDF. Requires Node.js 22+; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-20","tools.js:661-738","packages/core/src/reports.js:1-11","package.json:34-45"]}
