{"unit_id":"LYL-Z__dsh-armorbreak#feature-1","repo":"LYL-Z/dsh-armorbreak","commit":"5a5f5165acd829a181a43f6de01e4687328aa629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArmorBreak 的功能「单项分析」：按能力 ID 对文件或目录运行分析，并把摘要、发现和证据关联到持久任务。通过 armorbreak_analyze 触发，返回任务状态和结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:661-738","packages/core/src/runner.js:624-685"]}
{"unit_id":"LYL-Z__dsh-armorbreak#feature-2","repo":"LYL-Z/dsh-armorbreak","commit":"5a5f5165acd829a181a43f6de01e4687328aa629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArmorBreak 的功能「可复用工作流」：将二进制、APK、源码审查、PCAP 或取证步骤组合运行；支持后台执行、查看状态、恢复和重试，产出步骤结果与报告。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:743-780","packages/core/src/workflows.js:1-80"]}
{"unit_id":"LYL-Z__dsh-armorbreak#feature-3","repo":"LYL-Z/dsh-armorbreak","commit":"5a5f5165acd829a181a43f6de01e4687328aa629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArmorBreak 的功能「证据与发现管理」：按任务查看、筛选或验证发现及其证据，也能检查证据和审计哈希链；结果保留验证状态与证据标识。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:875-953","packages/core/src/runner.js:624-685"]}
